Text_en:
Two Iranian sources and an Omani source for 
@IranNuances
 : The short communication between the Iranian Foreign Minister, the US Presidential Envoy and Jared Kushner in Muscat was a simple greeting as a usual diplomatic practice that was conducted during previous rounds as well.

